================================================================================
WHY GPL: COPYLEFT CHAIN
================================================================================
flexiprobes imports primer3-py for optional melting-temperature / hairpin
scoring. primer3-py — and the libprimer3 C code it compiles in — is licensed
GPLv2-or-later. Under that copyleft, the combined, distributed work must itself
be GPL. We therefore release flexiprobes under GPL-3.0-or-later, which is
compatible with primer3 (usable under v3) and with PySide6's GPL-3.0 option.

