  be able to relink or replace the Qt libraries does NOT apply to us. The
  obligation that does apply is GPLv3's: convey the Corresponding Source for the
  whole work — satisfied by SOURCE-OFFER.txt and the public repository.

  The binaries are built as PyInstaller "onedir" (not "onefile") anyway, as a
