================================================================================
PRIVACY / NETWORK ACCESS
================================================================================
flexiprobes runs fully offline. It collects no analytics and makes no network
connection of its own. The one third-party component capable of network access
is the bundled NCBI BLAST+, whose default usage-statistics reporting the app
explicitly disables (see the NCBI BLAST+ note above). BLAST databases and input
FASTAs you supply are read locally; nothing is uploaded.

